{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30973","headline":"新雪八韵 · 薛能","name":"新雪八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大雪满初晨，开门万象新。\n龙锺鸡未起，萧索我何贫。\n耀若花前境，清如物外身。\n细飞斑户牖，乾洒乱松筠。\n正色凝高岭，随流助要津。\n鼎消微是滓，车碾半和尘。\n茶兴留诗客，瓜情想戍人。\n终篇本无字，谁别胜阳春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}